+/*
+ * RX error-ring single MSDU-buffer adapter. Caller has unmapped DMA, detached
+ * the RX descriptor, and holds a DP vdev reference. Always consumes nbuf.
+ * Only bounded, complete RAW frames are eligible for OSIF delivery.
